<overview>
<p>Foot infantry platoons are the most basic and numerous conventional military formation across the Inner Sphere and Periphery. Deployed on foot without dedicated transport, these platoons are slow to reposition but cheap to raise, easy to supply, and capable of holding ground that faster units cannot afford to garrison permanently. Every major military fields foot platoons in enormous numbers for planetary defense, installation security, and rear-area policing. Their lack of mobility makes them poorly suited for offensive operations against armored forces, but in prepared defensive positions, urban terrain, or dense forests, dismounted infantry remain difficult to dislodge without committing disproportionate resources.</p><p>Equipped with laser rifles that offer superior range and armor penetration compared to ballistic weapons, these platoons field one of the most effective personal arms available to conventional infantry, though the weapons are significantly more expensive and require soldiers to carry additional power packs. These Xenoplanetary Condition Troops carry specialized survival gear for hostile environments that would kill standard infantry: extreme temperatures, toxic atmospheres, crushing gravity. Where other troops cannot operate, XCT platoons fight as though conditions were normal.</p>
</overview>

<notes>
Intro date based on prototype date of generic Laser Rifle weapon
